cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the associated manuscript and this repository."
title: "TyG index and 28-day mortality in hospitalized people with HIV: analysis code"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "wyc904"
repository-code: "https://github.com/wyc904/tyg-hiv-mortality"
url: "https://github.com/wyc904/tyg-hiv-mortality"
abstract: >-
  R analysis code for a single-centre retrospective cohort study evaluating the
  association between the triglyceride-glucose (TyG) index and 28-day mortality
  in hospitalized people with HIV. The repository covers data harmonisation,
  TyG derivation and grouping, descriptive analyses, Cox / Kaplan-Meier /
  restricted cubic spline models, ROC / AUC / DeLong / NRI-IDI / decision-curve
  analyses, subgroup and forest plots, and cytokine standardisation and
  visualisation. Raw data are not included for patient-privacy reasons.
keywords:
  - TyG index
  - HIV
  - 28-day mortality
  - survival analysis
  - clinical research
  - R
